# PQ-007: A common-ion wash sacrifices less precipitate than pure water
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 20mL
add v1 AgNO3 0.0001mol
add v1 NaCl 0.0001mol
new
add v2 water 20mL
add v2 AgNO3 0.0001mol
add v2 NaCl 0.0001mol
new
new
filter v1 v3
filter v2 v4
add v1 water 200mL
add v2 water 200mL
add v2 NaCl 0.0002mol
new
new
filter v1 v5
filter v2 v6
inspect
